{
    = DROP
    ~ DELETE
    ~ CLEAR
    ~ REMOVE
}

::Views::
A view can refer to multiple tables using which of the following keyword?
{
    ~UNION
    ~GROUP
    =JOIN
    ~CONCAT
}

::Views::
A View can be used to select a subset of the table columns.{T}

::Views::
Views are not updatable. {
    ~ True
    = False
}

::Views::
What is 'xyz' in the following statement?\n

CREATE VIEW xyz AS SELECT a, b FROM t;

{
    ~table
    ~database
    ~column name
    =view name
}
